      "text": "A Mumbai tiffin delivery service needs to track orders as they move\nthrough stages - from kitchen preparation to final delivery, Delivery\nstaff update the status at each checkpoint.",
      "fontSize": 28.17789072426937,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A Mumbai tiffin delivery service needs to track orders as they move\nthrough stages - from kitchen preparation to final delivery, Delivery\nstaff update the status at each checkpoint.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
